WEBVTT

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.000
Did that wake you up?

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.440
Hmph!

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.740
Men are just so stupid.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:18.350
Argue and fight until you see eye to eye.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:22.220
That's just how guys seem to get along.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:32.950
<i>In the city without love</i> <i>only your smile remains.</i>

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:42.960
<i>Hold me tight to crush the loneliness,</i> <i>it's all that stops these pains.</i>

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:53.380
<i>You're constrained by that limit.</i>
<i>Free yourself and break apart the chains.</i>

00:00:53.380 --> 00:01:03.380
<i>It's all gonna burn on down.</i>
<i>Dance to the flames that consume the night.</i>

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:13.560
<i>The inferno rages on. It's almost</i> <i>as beautiful as you. Beautiful and bright.</i>

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:24.080
<i>Dance to the end of the night.</i>

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:34.080
<i>The inferno rages on. It's almost</i> <i>as beautiful as you. Beautiful and bright. Dance!</i>

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:44.760
<i>In the city without love</i>

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:57.950
"5: Assault"

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:02.450
We still don't have nearly enough.

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:07.790
Almost all of the lords near the castle are in Delzaine's good graces.

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:08.890
True.

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:14.830
Most of them don't understand our purpose and would rather see us fail.

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:17.730
If only they would side with us...

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:19.170
Indeed.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:23.310
But they're hostile before they even attempt to listen.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:25.310
Yes, but remember...

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:30.210
The more north we go, the fewer lords bend to Delzaine's will.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.920
We should be able to gain their support.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:40.020
Right. Those who've defied the king were forced north, and I'm sure they're tired of his rule.

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:41.990
That's very true.

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:45.590
However, we're still in the dark when it comes to the Royal Guard.

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:47.030
Eighty thousand.

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:53.170
The Royal Guard has nearly 80,000 soldiers.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:55.940
I see... That's more than we imagined.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:03:01.210
If we were to revolt now, we'd be fighting a losing battle.

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:04.280
I'd rather not a single death be in vain.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:06.920
A revolt won by great sacrifice is not what I want.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.520
Demetrio...

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:10.420
Of course I agree, but...

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:15.860
It will take ages to amass an army greater than the Royal Guard.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:20.130
And that's why we need their help.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.900
The Zoozians, you mean?

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:22.970
Yes.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.770
Ally with the Zoozians? Are you mad?

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:28.600
What makes you think you can reason with them?

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.110
Have you ever dealt with the Zoozians before?

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:34.580
Delzaine employs some of them as his protectors.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.110
Oh? You mean that guy?!

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:41.120
We, I mean... I was attacked by one outside the castle.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.320
He was insanely strong!

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.220
You...

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:47.890
He didn't seem like a guy you could talk it out with.

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:49.760
But did you try talking with him?

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:51.660
What? Uh, no...

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:53.600
Maybe you should try next time.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.970
Huh? Okay...

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:59.100
The Zoozians have long been oppressed by kings and nobles.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.940
They may be willing to side with us.

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:05.980
If they choose to, we will gain a powerful ally.

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:07.140
Louise.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.910
When the time comes, we'll need you to be our negotiator.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:11.810
Sure. I can do that.

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:17.320
We want them to stand with us and uphold all that we fight for.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:20.690
They deserve to be more than just pawns in a battle.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:26.830
I'm not really following all of this, but I just want to get to Babylon.

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:27.960
Hey, Demetrio.

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.030
Hmm?

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:33.500
The whole point of this revolution is to bring down Delzaine, right?

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.540
Yeah.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:38.170
I'm pretty sure the king is heading towards Babylon.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.940
What? Babylon?

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:44.700
Come on, you two. I'll patch up your wounds.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:53.990
Is Demetrio seriously considering an alliance with the Zoozians?

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:56.060
It's no mistake that they're strong...

00:04:56.060 --> 00:05:00.900
But does he really think they can be friends?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.530
If his plan ends up working...

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.970
...I won't need this guy's help anymore.

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:09.840
If I can get this rebellion to take me to Babylon...

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:13.640
...I can finally ditch this punk and get on my way.

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:17.680
Just looking at his face is pissing me off...

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:20.740
It sucks just breathing the same air as him.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:25.750
You okay? Does it hurt?

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:27.320
No, I'm all right.

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:30.160
You two sure went all out on each other.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:33.320
Don't worry, I'll clean you right up.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:35.100
Hmph!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.170
We're here. Step inside.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.730
Oh great. With him?

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.670
We've got to go in together?

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:41.770
Dammit.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:45.040
What's with you two? Hurry up and get inside.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:50.050
Stand around too long and you'll get bit by an Endora mosquito.

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:53.180
Huh? Who cares, it's just a bug.

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:54.750
Just... a bug?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:06:00.460
If one of those starts sucking your blood, you'll end up dead and dry as a bone.

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:03.460
Seriously? Are they related to Dracula?!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:04.760
Dra...cu...?

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.030
Oh. Just forget it.

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:10.630
Well, I'll go get the medicine so you two squeeze inside.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:19.040
That scary looking guy was a Zoozian, right?

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:23.250
What gives? Why does he look like a monster?

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.050
--Hey!
--Don't talk to me.

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.120
What?!

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.150
I don't need you anymore.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:29.220
Say what?!

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:32.810
What's wrong? Are you two fighting again?

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:38.130
Which one was it...

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:42.500
Does Demetrio really plan to ally with the Zoozians?

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:46.400
He thinks those monsters will actually listen to him?

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:50.440
Not everyone is born equal.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:54.010
But we mustn't take from others the right to live freely.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:55.310
Hmm?

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.450
That's what Demetrio always says.

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:02.790
There's good reason why the Zoozians became violent.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.120
There are the Endras...

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:07.860
...the people of Endora born between humans and a species called Anadua.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:12.490
The Zoozians were those born between the Anadua and animals.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:17.200
Long ago, the Endras and the Zoozians coexisted in peace and harmony.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:21.270
But eventually, the Endras began persecuting the Zoozians.

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:23.810
The kings thought they were clever.

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:29.680
By ruling over others with power, they tried to unite all of Endora.

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:35.120
Now the Endras are being oppressed like the Zoozians have been for so long.

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:37.790
I never thought I'd see the day.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:38.550
Huh?

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:42.020
Half of the blood running through me is Zoozian, you know?

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.230
Really?!

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:46.560
Surprising, right?
You wouldn't know just by looking.

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:50.970
Many Zoozians look frightening, and most don't say much either.

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:53.500
That's why people are afraid of them.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:56.630
Well, I... Sorry...

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:59.880
Now then. Let's take care of those wounds.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:01.140
Who's first?

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:01.910
Me!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.010
No, me!

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:03.850
I said it first!

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:07.220
Sheesh, fine! I'll do you both at the same time!

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:08.580
Keep your face still!

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:10.020
Ow ow!

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:12.420
Hey, Louise.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.190
Hmm?

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:16.260
Has Demetrio ever met with a Zoozian before?

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:17.530
Yeah.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:22.100
Demetrio is from a noble family, and quite a prestigious one, too.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:25.770
He lived his life without a care in the world.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.340
He told me that himself.

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:32.610
He could have had it easy if he just didn't give a damn.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.280
But he chose differently.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:38.010
There was a friend of his...

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.710
...who was a Zoozian.

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:14.280
It'll be dark real soon...

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:28.000
P-Please don't kill me!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.160
I-I'll give you everything I have!

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:40.610
You a kid from the estate?

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:41.480
What's your name?

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.480
D-Demetrio.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:45.110
I'm Lucio.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:46.840
I'll take you home.

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:53.450
Scaredy cat!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.700
Will you be fine from here?

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.700
Yeah. Thanks.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.300
See you, Demetrio.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.470
Lucio? Can I see you again?

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:11.460
Sure. If you want to see me, just do this.

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:16.010
Okay!

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.330
Demetrio!

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:12.600
Lucio!

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:26.520
Lucio! You've got a Warp Relic?

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:27.880
Yeah!

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:29.450
I don't have one...

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.550
That's why I'm so weak.

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:32.890
If only I had one...

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:34.790
Warp Relics have nothing to do with it.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.220
You train to get strong.

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:41.760
It doesn't matter!
Without a Warp Relic, I'll never be strong!

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:42.700
You're a wimp!

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.100
Shut up!

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.370
You little...

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:56.240
You already have courage.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:59.920
You're the one who faced it first, remember?

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:02.050
With training you can become strong.

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:05.750
But courage is something you're born with.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.800
Hey. Let's go get something good to eat.

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:19.100
Shouldn't you go back soon?
Your family will be worried.

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:22.740
I'm fine. I'll be 15 starting next month.

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:24.410
I'm basically an adult now.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:26.740
Yeah? So mature...

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.910
Stand up, you runt!

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.950
Who said you could rest?!

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:34.580
You're fricking useless!

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.490
What are you doing? Cut it out!

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:39.420
Who the hell are you?
It's none of your damn business.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:40.760
You should be ashamed!

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:42.160
Shut up!

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:48.030
Lucio?

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:52.470
You scum! An animal like you dares draw a Warp Relic on a person?!

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:53.870
Know your place!

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.140
Lucio!

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.470
Quit it!

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:08.710
Lu... cio...

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:20.030
I'm so sorry, Lucio.

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:22.000
This is all my fault.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:23.630
Demetrio...

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:25.470
Thank you...

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:26.900
Lucio?

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:32.970
It's been fun... being friends... with you.

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:34.370
Demetrio...

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.350
Lucio...

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:46.250
I... will become strong.

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:04.940
Demetrio?

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.540
Hmm?

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:07.840
How were they?

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:11.280
I treated their wounds, but they're the same as always.

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:12.710
You sure about leaving them alone?

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:14.180
They'll be fine.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:16.180
What if they start fighting again?

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:18.690
No worries. I told you already...

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:22.890
They'll argue and fight until they see eye to eye.

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:25.260
I swear, guys are so stupid...

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:31.400
Who cares about this revolt or killing the king?

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:34.140
I just want to get home as fast as possible.

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:39.740
Does Demetrio really think the Zoozians will side with him?

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:43.410
I know! I'll try asking that one guy tomorrow...

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:45.480
Who cares what happens with this revolt?

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:47.310
As long as he's dead in the end...

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.900
Whatever. Who cares about him?

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:03.730
Eljuia?

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:04.670
What is it?

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.230
Do you have a minute?

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:13.140
I wanted to ask you about my future that you saw yesterday.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.680
Sure...

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.080
If you saw it again, would you know more about it?

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.310
It's quite possible.

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:20.750
I see...

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:23.990
Hey! What the heck is that?!

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:25.990
Look over there! You see that?!

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:28.620
Go check it out, Eljuia!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.760
There's nothing here.

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:47.610
Dammit!

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.310
I see something...

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:55.480
If you can find an Endora bluebird...

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:58.520
...you will be able to return to the surface.

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.450
Really?!

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:01.660
I sense one of them in this direction.

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:03.060
Sweet!

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.160
Son of a--

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:12.320
Endora bluebird!

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:15.970
There's no bird called that.

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:18.910
It's revenge for trying to make me fall.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:22.080
You can't see the future unless you're hurt?

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.810
That's not always the case.

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:28.680
To be honest, I can't tell when or where it will happen.

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:30.080
I see...

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.230
According to the scout...

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:42.700
...the scent of the revolutionary army is nearby.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:45.200
The prince and that boy seem to be with them.

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:46.670
The Ignauts!

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.100
We should track and ambush them.

00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:50.070
Agreed.

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:51.670
What about that boy?

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:53.740
Can we pummel his face?

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:55.180
Agreed!

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:57.210
Do as you please.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:59.550
But do not harm the prince.

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:01.850
Good! You just made my day!

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:08.290
It's him.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.350
Perfect. He's mine.

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:13.560
That's so weird...

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:15.700
I don't see it anywhere!

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:18.070
Was it this way?

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:19.700
We meet again, brat!

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:22.440
What?! You're that Zoozian guy from the castle!

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:24.960
I'm flattered you remember.

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:35.050
It's him!

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.270
Hey! What happened to the prince?

00:17:58.270 --> 00:17:59.410
Like I care!

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:03.440
You're a smug little shit, but I like that!

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:08.980
He's too strong! At this rate I'm gonna die!

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.450
Dammit!

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:12.790
I don't care what happens to him!

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:14.190
What am I doing?!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:19.360
I'm screwed!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.300
He doesn't even matter to me!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.010
Why did it have to be you?!

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.050
Shut up!

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.780
I don't want your help!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:41.550
Just get up already!

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:44.820
Don't just stand there!

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:47.120
You always get in my way!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:48.820
Let's deal with this guy first!

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:50.630
No shit!

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:56.290
They want you back in one piece, prince, but I have a better idea!

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:05.670
So you're the leader of the Ignauts?

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:07.140
Correct. My name is--

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:08.840
Your name means nothing.

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:12.010
After all, this is where the Ignauts end!

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:14.810
In your dreams.

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:24.730
You'll have to get past me first!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:28.250
Oh really? I didn't know you had a death wish!

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:32.930
Shun!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:40.870
What?!

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:50.890
Wh-What is this?!

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:53.960
His Warp Relic evolved?!

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:55.620
Emilio! Now!

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:12.210
We did it?

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:35.430
Don't you think being
Delzaine's pawn is a bit pathetic?

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:39.400
I don't want to be lectured by rebel scum like you.

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:43.640
We reap the rewards of offering our service to the powerful.

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:45.070
That's all it is.

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:49.070
We call that selling your soul to the devil!

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.790
"To be continued..."

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:09.500
<i>Took a long way to get here</i>

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:13.470
<i>Had to go around and around</i>

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:17.610
<i>But every single road I've taken</i>

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:21.480
<i>Made me who I am today</i>

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:28.440
<i>go my way go my way</i>

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:39.890
<i>The world will show you there's tomorrow</i>

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:48.460
<i>Look up to the blue sky and you will see</i>

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:57.350
<i>I try to be better than who I was yesterday</i>

00:21:57.350 --> 00:22:04.520
<i>So I can see you with a smile on my face today</i>

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:09.760
<i>Now what should we get into today?</i>

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:18.400
<i>The scent of summer arouses my heart</i>

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:23.540
<i>And I can't seem to find the right words to tell you</i>

00:22:23.540 --> 00:22:28.000
<i>That I love you just the way you are</i>

00:22:35.050 --> 00:22:39.850
"Episode 6: Determination"

00:22:37.590 --> 00:22:39.590
Next episode, "Determination."
